    description: "Included for completeness rather than as a recommendation. Everything about this machine is built to a commercial standard, it is the quietest thing here under load, and a home user operating it an hour a day is using perhaps an eighth of its designed duty cycle. All of that is true and none of it makes it a sensible home purchase for most people, including most people shopping this category. The honest position is that the T3 delivers the specifications that matter for a heavy home user — AC motor, 3-inch rollers, 400 lb capacity, immovable frame — at a fraction of the cost, and the additional money here buys durability margin that a home duty cycle will never consume. If cost genuinely is not a consideration and you want the best available, this is it. Otherwise it is the wrong answer to the right question.",
